  "schema:version": "20180118",
  "schema:datePublished": "2022-09-08T11:10:00",
  "schema:description": "Measurements of irradiance (PAR) at depth from the North Atlantic. Vertical profiles of downwelling light intensities were measured with a hyperspectral radiometer by lowering the instrument over the side of the vessel, as close to solar noon as possible. Light levels were then integrated over the spectral range 400 - 700 nm, generating estimates of photosynthetically active radiation (PAR).\n\nPurpose: Light levels",
  "schema:creativeWorkStatus": "completed",
